@startuml ios-stream-proxy
!include _theme.puml
participant "AVPlayer" as A
participant "StreamProxy\n127.0.0.1 (NWListener)" as P #EEF4FC
participant "URLSession\n(app-owned)" as U
participant "Station" as S

A -> P : GET /<token>
P -> U : GET stream (app headers)
U -> S : connect
S --> U : 200 · icy-metaint · audio
U --> P : bytes
P --> A : same response (ICY kept)

== The station drops a connection that streamed ≥ 3 s ==
S -x U : connection closed
P -> U : new upstream at the live edge
U -> S : connect
S --> U : audio
P --> A : spliced into the SAME response\nICY re-framed at the original cadence
note right of A: AVPlayer never sees the drop:\nno gap, no state change

== The item is replaced (reconnect / stop / release) ==
P -> U : cancel upstream immediately
A -> P : late internal retry for the old token
P --> A : 410 Gone (never reaches the station)
@enduml
